 "Four crews. Four stations.\nGold Standard Radio, AM 10.40 — nothing but the classics, nothing but respect.\nLa Onda, 98.6 — the loudest signal on the water.\nRadio Los Santos, 106 — the block, the beat and the bounce.\nAnd 88.8 The Firm, which does not take requests, because it plays what's optimal.\nOn the night, whichever crew is up, that's what the room sounds like.\nYou'll feel the station change before anybody tells you it has.",
